\n  \">\n\n  <style>\n    #klarna-info-content h2 {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    #klarna-info-content h3 {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      margin-top: 15px;\n      margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    #klarna-info-content p {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n  <\/style>\n\n  <h2>Hoe werkt Klarna?<\/h2>\n\n  <h3>Stap 1: Kies Klarna bij het afrekenen<\/h3>\n  <p>Selecteer Klarna als betaalmethode tijdens het afrekenen.<\/p>\n\n  <h3>Stap 2: Betaal de eerste termijn direct<\/h3>\n  <p>Bij het afronden van je bestelling betaal je direct de eerste termijn.<\/p>\n\n  <h3>Stap 3: Betaal de resterende termijnen later<\/h3>\n  <p>De resterende twee termijnen worden automatisch afgeschreven met elk één maand tussentijd.<\/p>\n\n  <h3>Stap 4: Geen rente of extra kosten<\/h3>\n  <p>Je betaalt geen rente of extra kosten zolang je op tijd betaalt.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n  <button id=\"close-klarna-popup\" class=\"button button--primary\">\n    Sluiten\n  <\/button>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- Overlay om achtergrond te dimmen -->\n<div id=\"klarna-overlay\" style=\"\n  display: none;\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  z-index: 999;\n\"><\/div>\n\n<!-- JavaScript voor pop-up functionaliteit -->\n<script>\n  document.getElementById('show-klarna-popup').addEventListener('click', function(event) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    \n    \/\/ Toon de pop-up en overlay\n    document.getElementById('klarna-popup').style.display = 'block';\n    document.getElementById('klarna-overlay').style.display = 'block';\n  });\n\n  \/\/ Sluitknop functionaliteit\n  document.getElementById('close-klarna-popup').addEventListener('click', function() {\n    document.getElementById('klarna-popup').style.display = 'none';\n    document.getElementById('klarna-overlay').style.display = 'none';\n  });\n\n  \/\/ Klik op overlay sluit pop-up\n  document.getElementById('klarna-overlay').addEventListener('click', function() {\n    document.getElementById('klarna-popup').style.display = 'none';\n    this.style.display = 'none';\n  });\n<\/script>"}},"out_of_stock_text_eQmccL":{"type":"out-of-stock-text","settings":{"preorder_message":"Door de enorme toename in de vraag naar dit product is het tijdelijk uitverkocht. Als u nu besteld bent u volgende week de eerste die hem geleverd krijgt.","unavailable_message":"Dit product is momenteel niet beschikbaar.","show_in_stock_message":false,"in_stock_message":"Op voorraad - Direct leverbaar","preorder_bg_color":"#fff9db","preorder_border_color":"#ffe58f","preorder_text_color":"#333333","unavailable_bg_color":"#ffebee","unavailable_border_color":"#ffcdd2","unavailable_text_color":"#d32f2f","available_bg_color":"#e8f5e8","available_border_color":"#c8e6c9","available_text_color":"#2e7d32","enable_debug":false}},"description_kgfJMj":{"type":"description","settings":{"collapse_content":false}},"liquid_cBMrVw":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"liquid":"<style>\n  .custom-bullet-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .custom-bullet-list li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center; \/* Center align checkmark with the text *\/\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .custom-bullet-list img {\n    width: 1em; \/* Match size to text *\/\n    height: 1em;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    flex-shrink: 0; \/* Prevent resizing *\/\n  }\n\n  .custom-bullet-list span {\n    font-weight: bold; \/* Make text bold *\/\n    line-height: 1.5em; \/* Maintain readability for multi-line text *\/\n  }\n<\/style>\n\n<ul class=\"custom-bullet-list\">\n  <li>\n    <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0888\/1219\/2090\/files\/Checkmark.svg?v=1732631297\" alt=\"Checkmark icon\" \/>\n    <span>{{ product.metafields.custom.main_product_benefit_1 }}<\/span>\n  <\/li>\n  <li>\n    <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0888\/1219\/2090\/files\/Checkmark.svg?v=1732631297\" alt=\"Checkmark icon\" \/>\n    <span>{{ product.metafields.custom.main_product_benefit_2 }}<\/span>\n  <\/li>\n  <li>\n    <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0888\/1219\/2090\/files\/Checkmark.svg?v=1732631297\" alt=\"Checkmark icon\" \/>\n    <span>{{ product.metafields.custom.main_product_benefit_3 }}<\/span>\n  <\/li>\n  <li>\n    <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0888\/1219\/2090\/files\/Checkmark.svg?v=1732631297\" alt=\"Checkmark icon\" \/>\n    <span>{{ product.metafields.custom.main_product_benefit_4 }}<\/span>\n  <\/li>\n  <li>\n    <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0888\/1219\/2090\/files\/Checkmark.svg?v=1732631297\" alt=\"Checkmark icon\" \/>\n    <span>{{ product.metafields.custom.main_product_benefit_5 }}<\/span>\n  <\/li>\n<\/ul>"}},"collapsible_text_TyRzcj":{"type":"collapsible_text","settings":{"title":"What is cold-air diffusion?","content":"<p>Cold-air diffusers disperse scents through <strong>nebulization<\/strong>—a process that breaks down fragrance oils into an ultrafine, dry mist. This advanced technology ensures that scents remain in the air <strong>up to 4 times longer<\/strong>. The nanoparticles in this mist are so small that they stay suspended for hours without leaving any residue. Unlike traditional diffusers, this cutting-edge method uses <strong>no water, alcohol, or heat<\/strong>, preserving the fragrance in its purest form.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_text_Q9pMXa":{"type":"collapsible_text","settings":{"title":"Why is cold-air diffusion better?","content":"<p>Cold-air diffusers can cover <strong>twice the area<\/strong> of traditional scented candles, reed diffusers, plug-ins, and ultrasonic diffusers. With cold-air diffusion, <strong>95% of the oil<\/strong> is effectively dispersed into the air, compared to <strong>only 30%-40%<\/strong> with traditional diffusers. They provide <strong>consistent, even scent distribution<\/strong> and allow you to <strong>precisely control intensity<\/strong>.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_text_dJt86C":{"type":"collapsible_text","settings":{"title":"Cold-air vs. traditional diffusers","content":"<ul><li><strong>Maximum scent diffusion<\/strong> – Cold-air diffusers disperse <strong>95-99% of the fragrance oil<\/strong> as ultrafine micro-particles, while ultrasonic diffusers are only <strong>30-50% effective<\/strong> due to dilution with water.<\/li><li><strong>Longer-lasting fragrance<\/strong> – The scent lingers <strong>up to 4 times longer<\/strong>, whereas mist from ultrasonic diffusers evaporates quickly or settles to the ground.<\/li><li><strong>Efficient oil usage<\/strong> – Our technology <strong>uses 50-80% less oil<\/strong>, so you can enjoy long-lasting fragrance without frequent refills.<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"collapsible_text_97ADVw":{"type":"collapsible_text","settings":{"title":"Technical Specifications","content":"<p><strong>Seamless Control:<\/strong> Manage effortlessly through the Bluetooth app<\/p><p><strong>Dimensions:<\/strong> 12 cm x 12 cm x 4 cm<\/p><p><strong>Weight:<\/strong> 450g<\/p><p><strong>Power Source:<\/strong> Battery Type D (included) or USB-C (also included)<\/p><p><strong>Coverage Area:<\/strong> 50 sq meters<\/p><p><strong>Material:<\/strong> Durable, lightweight ABS plastic with a matte finish<\/p><p><strong>Technology:<\/strong> Water-free nebulizing diffusion<\/p><p><strong>Compatibility:<\/strong> Works exclusively with Scentech ScentPods<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_text_UPHcAz":{"type":"collapsible_text","settings":{"title":"Shipping & Returns","content":"<p><strong>Free express shipping on orders over €30<\/strong><br\/>Enjoy fast, free shipping on orders above €30, with options for Express or Standard shipping available at checkout. All duties and taxes are included for a hassle-free experience.<\/p><p><strong>Returns<\/strong><br\/>We offer a 30-day return policy on all Scentech products. To start a return, simply reach out to our customer service team at <a href=\"mailto:support@scentech.store\" title=\"mailto:support@scentech.store\"><strong>support@scentech.store<\/strong><\/a><\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_text_QP7fNm":{"type":"collapsible_text","settings":{"title":"Cleaning & Maintenance","content":"<p>Our Smart Aroma Diffuser is designed to be <strong>low-maintenance<\/strong>, so you can focus on enjoying your favorite fragrances. However, it can never hurt to give it a quick clean every once in a while. Simply:<\/p><p><strong>Remove the ScentPod<\/strong> and wipe the nozzle with a soft, dry cloth to keep it running smoothly.<\/p><p><strong>For a deeper clean<\/strong>, use a cotton swab dipped in isopropyl alcohol to gently clean the nozzle. Let it dry completely before reattaching the ScentPod.<\/p><p>That's all it takes to keep your diffuser performing at its best, delivering consistent, high-quality fragrance.<\/p>","page":""}},"video_reviews_carousel_37NTdF":{"type":"video_reviews_carousel","settings":{"heading":"Join 10 000+ happy customers with an amazing smelling home.","heading_color":"#160000","background_color":"#ffffff","video_1":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/SnapInsta.to_AQPSJ7H1MUXDvAyKpOvQBSSWYlv0fP3O8xzA5qgvXgwzEnKeCA2AcTHK1dwsRi7FyYDCm7XxRIJKzK1bOI6kA-Or2zahnboh0csQTYc.mp4","reviewer_name_1":"thuis.bij.leonie","reviewer_avatar_1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PF-leonie.jpg","verified_1":true,"video_2":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/098a63e18ce5405cbc9a7fa7de177480.mp4","reviewer_name_2":"wonen.met.lef","reviewer_avatar_2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PF-wonenmetlef.jpg","verified_2":true,"video_3":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/AD- More than a diffuser …this little light is functional art.A cozy-home gift idea for the holi.mp4","reviewer_name_3":"mona.amezguerra","reviewer_avatar_3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PF-Mona.jpg","verified_3":true,"video_4":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/copy_59A6FE73-AE36-41E8-9438-42F2F1ABE98F.mov","reviewer_name_4":"stacyhoogland","reviewer_avatar_4":"